body:
After split  into `yii\log\Logger` and `yii\log\Dispatcher` if set in config 'traceLevel'

``` php
        'log' => [
            'traceLevel' => YII_DEBUG ? 3 : 0,
            'targets' => [
                [
                    'class' => 'yii\log\FileTarget',
                    'levels' => ['error', 'warning'],
                ],
            ],
        ],
```

 called error 'Creating default object from empty value' on yii\log\Dispatcher at line number 106

``` php
    public function setTraceLevel($value)
    {
        $this->logger->traceLevel = $value;
    }
```

because yii\log\Dispatcher::init()  is not called yet and $this->logger is null.

@SuperPuppet not working if 'traceLevel' is set

``` php
        'log' => [
            'traceLevel' => YII_DEBUG ? 3 : 0,
            'targets' => [
                [
                                    'file' => [
                    'class' => 'yii\log\FileTarget',
                    'levels' => ['error', 'warning'],
                                        ],
                ],
            ],
        ],
```
